<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questDescription->一名鼠族游击队信使携带着关于某些王国罪证的关键情报抵达殖民地。 你需要在殖民地保护她进行8小时的情报传输。在此期间，敌对势力可能会试图杀死这名信使。预计会有两次攻击即将到来。</li>
  -->
  <RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>A Ratkin Partisan messenger carrying critical intelligence about certain Kingdom crimes arrives at the colony. You need to protect her in the colony for 8 hours while she transmits the intelligence. During this period, hostile forces may attempt to kill the messenger. Two attacks are expected to occur.</RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
